                      <SHORT-NAME>DmaDestinationCircularBufferSize</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Configure the circular size of the circular buffer for the destination address.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
